WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Design review. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: State assumptions and evidence limits

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: An aerodynamic review states reference area, conditions, uncertainty and validation method. A smooth rendering cannot prove performance.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Present the model, one sensitivity check, a test plan and one factor the model omits.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: AP model defense

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Simplified flow picture; real values need test method and conditions.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: State assumptions and evidence limits
